A||||17||Songman||Cool night at the gym!||||1||
Z||000000||Songman||08-28-2001||09:04 PM||||I joined a gym a couple of weeks ago and got a personal trainer... Trying to get this tired old body back in shape. Well, the trainer and owner of the gym has been in this business for over 30 years so he knows everyone! This afternoon when I walked in, who did I find on the treadmill next to me but Tommy Lasorda of the LA Dodgers! Very cool! He's in town all week and is going to come to the gym every afternoon. He says he'll be happy to have pictures made and sign a couple of autographs! I'm excited!<P>And tomorrow 'Big Sexy' Kevin Nash and "Big Show' Paul Wight are going to be in there! Those are some big dudes! Hope I can get a picture with them too!<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A>||||reg||1
Z||000001||starfighter007@msn.com||08-28-2001||09:09 PM||||what kinda health /gym is this ?it dont sound like we will be get to in shape this week with all the goings ons there better give us 50 push ups  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||1
Z||000002||Songman||08-28-2001||09:15 PM||||Oh, it's all about working out. I was pointing out tonight to my girlfriend that this gym is not full of 'pretty people' in there to be seen. It is full of people just like us that are there to work. These folks just drop in when they are in town because they know the owner and it gives them a place to work out when they are in town.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A>||||reg||1
