Z||000013||Songman||08-31-2001||08:07 PM||||I've wasted a lot of money on gyms in the past. Signed contracts, paid the money, and just never went... I'm really motivated this time for some reason. I go every day through the week and take weekends off. This guy who is training me really knows his stuff and makes it seem more fun than work.. even though I am sore all of the time! Plus, like I said earlier, this is not a musclehead place with all of the people who are already in shape flaunting their stuff. These are everyday people trying to get to a place they feel comfortable. It feels good to be there.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A>||||reg||7
